CM_ "Ford Performance Gen 4 Coyote control pack broadcast (the 0x270-set). TRANSCRIBED FROM THE OFFICIAL TABLES: IS_M-6017-M50HM (Gen 4X, 09/16/24) p.36 'CAN Message Definition' and IS_M-6017-73M (7.3L, 02/21/23) s.12.0 p.29 (byte-identical tables), performanceparts.ford.com/download/instructionsheets/. Confidence for the M50D dual-throttle-body pack's Gateway Module: OFFICIAL-SIBLING (the M50D sheet documents the GWM generic-gauges HS-CAN broadcast but prints no table; sniff-verify at first car contact). Ford bit numbering in the source tables is 0-63 with bit 0 = MSB of byte 0 (Motorola); DBC start bits below use the standard sawtooth convention. Classic CAN 2.0, 11-bit IDs, HS-CAN 500 kbps. Rates: 0x270 @ 100 Hz, 0x274 @ 50 Hz, 0x275 @ 50 Hz, 0x278 @ 10 Hz.";
CM_ BO_ 624 "0x270, 10 ms. Confidence: official (sibling tables agree byte-for-byte).";
CM_ BO_ 628 "0x274, 20 ms. Confidence: official. A/F = raw*0.01+7 (PCM encodes ((lambda*stoich)-7)*100); AF0/AF1 are per-bank wideband. FUEL_PRESSURE: rail on PFI / lift pump on DPFI.";
CM_ BO_ 629 "0x275, 20 ms. Confidence: official. VSPD encoded as mph*1.60934 by the PCM; 0.1 km/h per bit.";
CM_ BO_ 632 "0x278, 100 ms. Confidence: official. ECT/EOT/TOT raw 214 = sensor degraded, raw 215 = sensor faulted (post-offset 174/175 degC) -- consumers must treat both as invalid, never convert. TOT has no dash channel and is not decoded.";
CM_ SG_ 624 ENGINE_SPEED "Ford bits 2-15, 14 bit, 1 rpm/bit.";
CM_ SG_ 624 ENGINE_SPEED_HZ "Ford bits 17-30, 0.01 Hz/bit = rpm/60. Not decoded by the dash (redundant with ENGINE_SPEED).";
CM_ SG_ 624 MAN_VAC "Ford bits 36-47, 0.1 kPa/bit, offset -105, gauge pressure. Not decoded (no dash channel).";
CM_ SG_ 624 DI_PRESSURE "Ford bits 49-63, kPa, DI engines only. Not decoded (FUELP comes from 0x274).";
CM_ SG_ 628 BOOST "Ford bits 16-24, kPa, boosted engines only. Not decoded (no dash channel).";
CM_ SG_ 628 AF0 "Ford bits 25-35 -> DASH_CH_AFR_L.";
CM_ SG_ 628 AF1 "Ford bits 36-46 -> DASH_CH_AFR_R.";
CM_ SG_ 628 FUEL_PRESSURE "Ford bits 47-55, kPa -> DASH_CH_FUELP (psi).";
CM_ SG_ 629 VSPD "Ford bits 0-11 -> DASH_CH_SPEED (mph).";
CM_ SG_ 632 ECT "Ford bits 0-7, degC = raw-40 -> DASH_CH_ECT (degF). Sentinels raw 214/215 invalidate.";
CM_ SG_ 632 EOT "Ford bits 8-15, degC = raw-40 -> DASH_CH_OILT (degF). Sentinels raw 214/215 invalidate.";
CM_ SG_ 632 TOT "Ford bits 16-23, transmission oil temp. NOT decoded (no dash channel).";
CM_ SG_ 632 EOP "Ford bits 24-33, kPa 0-1023 -> DASH_CH_OILP (psi).";
CM_ SG_ 632 SHIFTER_POS "Ford bits 36-39. Not decoded.";
CM_ SG_ 632 CODES_COUNT "Ford bits 40-47, DTC count. Not decoded.";
CM_ SG_ 632 VBAT "Ford bits 48-58, 0.01 V/bit -> DASH_CH_VOLTS.";
CM_ SG_ 632 GEAR "Ford bits 60-63. Not decoded (dash computes gear from rpm/speed on TRACK; no channel).";
